"desktop application: a ``serve`` daemon exposing the engine over HTTP + "
"JSON, a multi-user PostgreSQL backend with per-tenant isolation (and "
"optional Row-Level Security), a ``migrate`` command to transfer a SQLite "
"database to PostgreSQL, and a generic ``call`` dispatcher giving command-"
"line access to every storage operation."

